 from \"@esfx/cancelable\";\r\n\r\nfunction doSomeWork(cancelable: Cancelable) {\r\n    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\r\n        const cancelSignal = cancelable[Cancelable.cancelSignal]();\r\n        if (cancelSignal.signaled) throw new Error(\"Operation canceled.\");\r\n\r\n        const child = fork(\"worker.js\");\r\n        const subscription = cancelSignal.subscribe(() => {\r\n            // cancellation requested, abort worker\r\n            worker.kill();\r\n            reject(new Error(\"Operation canceled.\"));\r\n        });\r\n\r\n        worker.on(\"exit\", () => {\r\n            subscription.unsubscribe();\r\n            resolve();\r\n        });\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n# API\r\n\r\nYou can read more about the API [here](https://esfx.js.org/esfx/api/cancelable.html).\r\n","readmeFilename":"README.md","homepage":"https://github.com/esfx/esfx#readme","_id":"@esfx/cancelable@1.0.0-dev.4","_nodeVersion":"16.17.1","_npmVersion":"lerna/3.22.1/node@v16.17.1+x64 (linux)","dist":{"integrity":"sha512-ms5PKwr4+xRjds01NomALgbZwdiYpVx+YzuWKnaM6bVnClXR6cPlKCyBc+Q+t/XbQUIHyZGBJ4F6yjBpUXltiw==","shasum":"5aae88ecbecc429894a28f450911b57a882d414d","tarball":"https://registry.npmjs.org/@esfx/cancelable/-/cancelable-1.0.0-dev.4.tgz","fileCount":8,"unpackedSize":52439,"signatures":[{"keyid":"SHA256:jl3bwswu80PjjokCgh0o2w5c2U4LhQAE57gj9cz1kzA","sig":"MEYCIQDpYpGiDn0sEc4sqUpbbuyClzHj1pFujC1DvL1Q5FFzkgIhAIH9AbGVRfrl+xwJHsDMVk/c4vkS9rrTa2GdULOxBymA"}],"npm-signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\r\nVersion: OpenPGP.js v4.10.10\r\nComment: https://openpgpjs.org\r\n\r\nwsFzBAEBCAAGBQJjT1+OACEJED1NWxICdlZqFiEECWMYAoorWMhJKdjhPU1b\r\nEgJ2Vmqp3hAAg5qiQLjptQhHmmcPIUXIOk4zwUmE1VG5U3ZWzhxueXoEG9Vv\r\ncMdGJP+RJrrPTu1foYPprl3Z0KtHLQAix06D3FcwJckUSVZVFRwLN/BuI2Xb\r\nuhp9MfveWMCrFPRFMQ+/0JjTX25i4E2q2leuXlhZIHZGTxuwFO1AASsLxD+H\r\nqwbTMq2lQPyKC5S4TRIjN+U47wQk1jgpiAiubi82uYxinOelrqdVX3hhjEOr\r\n8+apY99X37wKa60b6E1q7PeOmR1elKzxtGCc6iDoXq7HsGYpXby8MNeybGIz\r\nDF7SgWzV4Y+29k